# Note formatting in Cloud Foundry docs

Always use `<p class="note">` for notes. Never use markdown blockquote syntax (`>`).

The closing `</p>` must always be on its own line.

**Bad (markdown blockquote):**
```
> **Note** Some important information here.
```

**Bad (closing tag inline):**
```html
<p class="note">Some important information here.</p>
```

**Good:**
```html
<p class="note">Some important information here.
</p>
```

Use the appropriate class for the severity level:

| Class | Use for |
|---|---|
| `note` | General informational notes |
| `note important` | Important warnings the reader must not overlook |
| `note caution` | Actions that may cause data loss or irreversible changes |

```html
<p class="note important">This action cannot be undone.
</p>

<p class="note caution">Deleting this service instance removes all associated data.
</p>
```
